{"prompt":"Brainstorm task for a C to Rust translation of a TOTP library. The source files are in the workspace root: totp.c, totp.h, std.c, std.h, main.c, test.c, Makefile, README.md, LICENSE.md. Target is Rust, tested with cargo test.

Read the source files, then list the core difficulties of translating to Rust and propose candidate approaches for the crate structure (modules, how to handle the buffer-clobbering sha1 API, how to map test.c to Rust tests, the CLI main.c, and the freestanding std files). Recommend the best approach with a concrete file layout (Cargo.toml, src/lib.rs, src/totp.rs, src/main.rs, tests).

Append your findings to notes.md in the workspace root under a section titled "## Brainstorm". Do not write any Rust code files yet. Report a concise summary when done."}

